---
<section id="vacanza" class="section bg-pattern-waves">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <h2 class="section-title">La Vacanza</h2>
        <div class="section-subtitle">Mare, Sport, Amicizia e Divertimento</div>
        <div class="grid-feature">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">🌊</div>
                <h3>Mare & Relax</h3>
                <p>Goditi il mare Adriatico e la piscina del villaggio tra un allenamento e l'altro.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">🥋</div>
                <h3>Karate di Alto Livello</h3>
                <p>Allenati con i campioni e i tecnici della Nazionale Italiana.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">🎉</div>
                <h3>Party & Divertimento</h3>
                <p>Serate a tema, animazione e momenti indimenticabili con nuovi amici.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
.bg-pattern-waves {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    background-image: radial-gradient(#0EA5E9 0.5px, transparent 0.5px), radial-gradient(#0EA5E9 0.5px, #f9fafb 0.5px);
    background-size: 20px 20px;
    background-position: 0 0, 10px 10px;
    opacity: 0.9;
}

.grid-feature {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    border-top: 5px solid var(--color-blue);
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
}

.card:nth-child(2) { border-top-color: var(--color-orange); }
.card:nth-child(3) { border-top-color: var(--color-yellow); }

.card-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
}
</style>
